Map data and tiles:
  The base map is CARTO's "Positron" style, loaded from basemaps.cartocdn.com
  and built from OpenStreetMap data. Map data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors,
  available under the Open Database Licence (ODbL); map tiles (c) CARTO.
  The attribution is shown on the map itself. No proprietary Mapbox SDK or
  Mapbox-hosted service is used; a self-hosted MapLibre style can replace
  the CARTO one by changing a single URL in apps/web/src/components/map/MapView.tsx.
